    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\$322\\,497.26$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Monthly contribution}&=176+150\\\\&=\\$326\\\\r&=\\frac{12\\%}{12}=1\\%\\text{ per month}\\\\n&=20\\times12=240\\end{align*}$$\nFrom the future value table, the factor for 240 periods at $1\\%$ per period is $989.2554$.\n$$\\begin{align*}FV&=989.2554\\times326\\\\&=\\$322\\,497.2604\\\\&\\approx\\$322\\,497.26\\end{align*}$$",
